    <h2>{{ t('US equity scoreboard — size, breadth & internals', '美股计分板 — 规模、广度与内部结构') }}
      {{ help("Three reads of how broad the US equity advance is, in one board. (1) SIZE & STYLE — small caps (Russell 2000) and mid caps measured against the large-cap S&P 500 (rising = participation broadening/risk-on, falling = a narrow mega-cap-led tape) plus the growth-vs-value style rotation; direction over the last 20 trading days, size ratios coloured by risk-on direction, growth/value left neutral. (2) MARKET BREADTH — across the full S&P Composite 1500 (large = S&P 500, mid = S&P 400, small = S&P 600): how many stocks are advancing, how many hold above their 50- and 200-day lines, and net new 52-week highs; the % above the 50-day line also feeds the regime model's growth axis, so this is the same breadth the model reads, just made legible. (3) MARKET INTERNALS — the classic desk internals beyond the %-above-MA snapshot: the McClellan Oscillator & Summation Index (breadth momentum), the Zweig Breadth Thrust gauge, the High-Low Index, whether the advance/decline line confirms price, and where participation sits in its own multi-decade history; computed on the DEEP S&P 500 breadth series (1962-). Internals are SECOND-DERIVATIVE, display-only reads — coincident with price by construction, they explain the tape, they do not forecast it (survivorship caveat: the deep series is rebuilt from today's members, so percentile context is over the mature-universe window only).", "把美股上涨的广度用三种读数汇于一板。(1) 规模与风格 —— 小盘（罗素2000）与中盘对大盘标普500衡量（上行 = 参与度扩散／风险偏好，下行 = 狭窄、由超大盘主导的盘面），并含成长对价值的风格轮动；看过去20个交易日的方向，规模比率按风险偏好方向着色，成长／价值保持中性。(2) 市场广度 —— 覆盖整个标普综合1500（大盘=标普500、中盘=标普400、小盘=标普600）：多少股票上涨、多少守在其50日与200日均线之上，以及净创52周新高；高于50日线的占比也进入周期模型的增长轴，与模型读取的是同一广度，只是更直观。(3) 市场内部结构 —— 超越「高于均线占比」快照的经典桌面内部指标：麦克莱伦振荡指标与累积指标（广度动量）、兹威格广度脉冲、新高—新低指数、腾落线是否确认价格，以及当前参与度在其数十年历史中的分位；基于标普500深度广度序列（1962年起）计算。内部结构是二阶、仅作展示的读数 —— 与价格同步，用于解释盘面而非预测（幸存者偏差提示：深度序列以当前成分股重建，故分位背景仅取成熟样本区间）。") }}
